---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | The Pellet Sauna Company"
  description="How The Pellet Sauna Company uses analytics cookies and handles information collected on pelletsauna.com."
>
  <main class="privacy-page">
    <a class="back-link" href="/">← Back to P1</a>
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="updated">Last updated: November 9, 2026</p>

    <section>
      <h2>What this site collects</h2>
      <p>
        If you contact us through the form, we receive the name, email, and message you submit so we can respond.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Reservations and payments</h2>
      <p>
        If you reserve a P1, we collect your name, email, phone number, and shipping address so we can process your reservation, contact you about it, and deliver your stove.
      </p>
      <p>
        Card details go directly to our payment processor, Stripe, and we never see or store your full card number. Stripe saves your card so your balance can be charged when your stove goes into production, and removes it from your reservation if you refund your deposit. Stripe handles this information under its own privacy policy.
      </p>
      <p>
        We share your reservation details only with the service providers needed to process your payment and deliver your stove. To look up or refund a reservation, we ask for the email and ZIP or postal code you used at checkout.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Email list</h2>
      <p>
        If you join our email list, we store your email address (and name, if you provide it) so we can send you P1 preorder and product updates. Our email provider, Resend, stores this information and delivers our messages on our behalf.
      </p>
      <p>
        Every marketing email includes an unsubscribe link, and you can also reply to any email to ask us to remove you. We do not sell or share your email address.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Analytics cookies</h2>
      <p>
        We use Google Analytics only if you accept cookies. Analytics cookies help us understand how people use the site (pages viewed, approximate location, device/browser type). Google may process this data under its own terms.
      </p>
      <p>
        You can accept or reject analytics when prompted. To change your choice later, clear this site’s data in your browser and reload the page.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about privacy: use the <a href="/#contact">contact form</a> on our homepage.
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .privacy-page {
    max-width: 40rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 2.5rem 1.25rem 4rem;
  }

  .back-link {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--text-medium);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
  }

  .back-link:hover {
    color: var(--text-dark);
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.25rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
  }

  .updated {
    color: var(--text-medium);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  section {
    margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  p {
    color: var(--text-medium);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  a {
    color: var(--sky-blue);
  }
</style>
